@startuml
title Quy trình tính giá vé động (Base Price + Pricing Rules)

actor "Nhân viên/Khách hàng" as User
participant "BookingController/POS" as Controller
participant "PricingService" as PricingService
participant "PricingRuleRepository" as RuleRepo
participant "BasePriceProvider" as BasePrice
participant "PriceDecoratorFactory" as Factory
participant "PriceDecorator" as Decorator

User -> Controller: Chọn ghế & Suất chiếu
Controller -> PricingService: calculateTicketPrice(showtime, seat)

PricingService -> RuleRepo: findActiveRulesByContext(date, roomType, format, seatType)
activate RuleRepo
RuleRepo --> PricingService: List<PricingRule>
deactivate RuleRepo

PricingService -> BasePrice: getBasePrice(seatType, roomType)
activate BasePrice
BasePrice --> PricingService: initialPrice
deactivate BasePrice

PricingService -> Factory: createDecoratorChain(initialPrice, rules)
activate Factory
loop Mỗi PricingRule
    Factory -> Decorator: wrap(currentDecorator, rule)
end
Factory --> PricingService: finalDecorator
deactivate Factory

PricingService -> Decorator: calculate()
activate Decorator
note right: Decorator sẽ cộng dồn (Additive) \nhoặc nhân tỉ lệ (Percentage) \ntheo từng mắt xích.
Decorator --> PricingService: finalPrice
deactivate Decorator

PricingService --> Controller: finalPrice
Controller --> User: Hiển thị giá vé
@enduml
